// Icons for Windows 11's own menu, which loads icons only from a PE resource ("path,-id"), not from an .ico file: SIC's mark in
// both sets, and SIC's letter tile for each agent (built by scripts\Build-AgentIcons.ps1), shown where a tool's own icon is not
// in its exe. The ids are ExplorerMenu.CommandIconIds in Sic.Core.
1   ICON "..\\Sic.App\\Assets\\brand\\sic.ico"
2   ICON "..\\Sic.App\\Assets\\brand\\sic-light.ico"
101 ICON "..\\Sic.App\\Assets\\icons\\claude.ico"
102 ICON "..\\Sic.App\\Assets\\icons\\codex.ico"
103 ICON "..\\Sic.App\\Assets\\icons\\hermes.ico"
104 ICON "..\\Sic.App\\Assets\\icons\\opencode.ico"
